  /** `null` when `rewarded` is `true`. Else why there is no reward: `"no_round"`, `"claimed"`, `"realmfatigue"`, `"hopsickness"`, `"merchant_home"`, `"host"`, `"no_visit"`, `"target_unavailable"` or `"wrong_target"` (node/logic/anniversary_event.js:53-107). */
